ent-OrbitraRatvarCrystal = abstraction crystal
    .desc = A brass obelisk with a shimmering crystalline core.
ent-OrbitraRatvarProjection = servant projection
    .desc = A translucent human outline bathed in golden light.
orbitra-ratvar-scripture-crystal = Abstraction Crystal
orbitra-ratvar-scripture-crystal-desc = Creates a projection anchor. Requires two crystals of the same cult on the station's main grid. Open one and select the other in its window: your body stays behind and the projection operates within 5 tiles. Your body receives 40% of its damage and the crystal receives 60%. Leaving the radius, losing a crystal or entering critical condition ends the projection. Temporary armaments are provided; your items are not copied.
orbitra-ratvar-crystal-project = Project: { $name } ({ $x }, { $y })
orbitra-ratvar-crystal-return = End projection
orbitra-ratvar-crystal-ready = Available. Projection requires another free, anchored crystal of your cult on the station's main grid. Open this crystal and select a destination.
orbitra-ratvar-crystal-title = Abstraction Crystal
orbitra-ratvar-crystal-help = Select a receiving crystal. Your body stays here. The projection operates within 5 tiles; damage is shared with your body and crystal.
orbitra-ratvar-crystal-name = This crystal's name
orbitra-ratvar-crystal-save = Save
orbitra-ratvar-crystal-search = Search crystals...
orbitra-ratvar-crystal-empty = No matching destinations. You need another crystal of your cult.
orbitra-ratvar-crystal-point-ready = Available for projection
orbitra-ratvar-crystal-point-busy = Occupied by another projection
orbitra-ratvar-crystal-point-invalid = Unavailable: anchor on the station's main grid
orbitra-ratvar-crystal-busy = Sustaining a projection. Another servant cannot occupy this crystal simultaneously.
orbitra-ratvar-crystal-denied = Projection unavailable: check ownership, anchoring and occupancy of both crystals. Your living body must be near the source crystal when activating it.
orbitra-ratvar-crystal-projection-name = Projection: { $name }
orbitra-ratvar-crystal-started = You manifest at the crystal. Stay within five tiles. Select End projection in your own or the crystal's context menu to return.
ent-OrbitraRatvarProjectionArmor = projected cuirass
    .desc = Translucent brass plates woven from light.
ent-OrbitraRatvarProjectionHelmet = projected helmet
    .desc = A luminous outline of a brass helmet.
ent-OrbitraRatvarProjectionSpear = projected spear
    .desc = A brass spearhead shimmers within a translucent shaft.
